{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2023-06", "window": 3, "start_date": 1686873600, "end_date": 1687478399, "month_true_total": 67, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:52:13 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "140518440", "author": {"steamid": "76561198107590844", "personaname": "Nexus-547", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198107590844/", "num_games_owned": 323, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1897, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 908, "last_played": 1745432547, "avatar": "60b48a1b8260e3174a7648baca800b63edd8fd92"}, "language": "english", "review": "roboquest is a rougelite shooter set in a distant future where humanity is trying to survive killer robots. \nthe most important elements in this kinda games are movement and shooting and they feel fun and tight enough. there is a nice array of weapons to choose from and builds feel different. this is and early access game so its not complete yet. content is a little bit slow but steady and there is not much bug. and soon they're going to release 1.0", "timestamp_created": 1687467677, "timestamp_updated": 1687467677, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "140475341", "author": {"steamid": "76561198143296041", "personaname": "Aston Machan :3", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/neverforgetmachan/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 44, "playtime_forever": 4603, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1232, "last_played": 1738911148, "avatar": "c056cf39b6aead844f773895cf94a1bfd34f11bf"}, "language": "english", "review": "very good game", "timestamp_created": 1687404503, "timestamp_updated": 1700777020, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "140428732", "author": {"steamid": "76561198053311086", "personaname": "EinarTheRed", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198053311086/", "num_games_owned": 322, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 2883, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 380, "last_played": 1748495795, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "My honest early impressions are while it is fun, I dont feel like I ever get cards often enough to form any actual synergy. Like maybe 2 cards that actually feel like they work well together. I feel like the game's progression through the upgrades could be faster by like 20-30% without taking anything away. And finally, I really cant say I enjoy how often the combat rooms come up. They are likely my least favorite part of the game and I feel like 40% of my playthoughs are in them. \n\nAll that said, the game is fun. Just feels like it could be just a bit better if it wasn't as much as a grindy slough.", "timestamp_created": 1687332656, "timestamp_updated": 1687332656, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "140341605", "author": {"steamid": "76561198263327503", "personaname": "M The Weeb", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198263327503/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 1345, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 304, "last_played": 1700663677, "avatar": "cf3876f92630e7cb9aacb9faba7eb871f74bb542"}, "language": "english", "review": "The gameplay is great, and the devs truly care about making this game fun (which is rare nowadays smh). even in EA this game is a blast. I def recommend, especially if you like quick gunplay (kinda like doom eternal)", "timestamp_created": 1687192570, "timestamp_updated": 1687192570, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "140337816", "author": {"steamid": "76561198310307060", "personaname": "pih", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/sixtwolatino/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 1754, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 362, "last_played": 1744675227, "avatar": "9b4dc907a478d30b915a2dc40d63c94345444f85"}, "language": "english", "review": "roguelike movement shooter that literally doesnt get boring like ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ what more could you ask for.\n\nPros:\n- Unique weapons\n- Movement Mechanics\n- Very Optimized\n- Bug Free (i think)\n\nCons:\n- Kinda hard (i think i need to just get better)\n- Going fast doesnt feel fast at times\n\nWishes:\n- Wish rocket jumping / mine jumping was more consistent\n- Wish for more viable guns and perks :3", "timestamp_created": 1687188051, "timestamp_updated": 1687188051, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}]}